  "reviewAB": {
    "$comment": [
      "Milliseconds, bundled with esbuild. The performance fixes: mergeKeys by marks (no Set or sort); a memoised leg rule-key list and shared empty facts; stepDuration without arrays; route metrics as running sums, continued by walkMetrics from prefix sums every 256 steps, with interned rule-key lists; the simulation cache and the availability caches shared per (rules, dataset), with every walker-keyed entry held weakly; one property order for restored states (review PERF-05..08). The digests of estimates, deltas, legs, metrics, issues, an edit and stateBefore are identical with and without the performance fixes on both routes.",
      "A focused rerun of the fully cold stress cases (5 repetitions) gave walk-cold 28.48 / 28.25 / 28.76 ms and validate-cold 45.67 / 47.02 / 48.34 ms (before / fixes / fixes and performance; spreads up to 2.5x under load): unchanged within the noise."
