  "derived10000": {
    "$comment": [
      "Edit to derived results published (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §12.1, §14: 50 ms; startup tasks under the 100 ms long-task rule), stored at the final verification after the Milestone 6 and 3b.6 fix pass (2026-09-26). First stored baseline: the review fixes changed the pipeline (PERF-02, PERF-03, NAV-03; the dataset-view cache raised from 2 to 4 views, PERF-06) and the bench gained --check and the classToggle case, so there was no earlier baseline to keep.",
      "Script: pnpm exec tsx tests/bench/derived.bench.ts --budget (21 runs after 3 warm-ups), the 10,000-step stress route of the bench (10,423 issues), straight-line travel except the nav cases. median is the median of five processes' medians (runMedians). Under tsx, as `--check <file>` runs it (it reads derived10000.<case>.median and fails on more than 25% over it). Not probe-normalised.",
      "Load: two stale background processes kept about two to three of the 16 logical processors busy (Windows load 24-33%). classChange is at the 50 ms budget under tsx (median 51.5 ms here) and within it bundled with esbuild, as a production build is (bundled: the `bundled` block, three processes; 43.2 ms). classChange rotates through three classes, so every change is to a class whose views the pipeline no longer holds (cold); classToggle switches between two, whose views it keeps."
    ],
